    "summary": {
      "en": "Book Collection Ring No Longer Class Restricted in WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "El anillo de colección de libros ya no está restringido en WoW: para siempre..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6abfbdcf944b75.36143925\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Throughout the world in World of Warcraft: Forever, players can collect various books that allow them to unlock new quests. At 20 books, you unlock the quest <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=79536/greater-friend-of-the-library\"><img alt=\"Greater Friend of the Library\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Greater Friend of the Library</span></a>, which grants the player one of two rings, including <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=281634/field-researchers-loop\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Field Researcher's Loop\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_02.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Field Researcher's Loop</span></a>. This item was previously a <span class=\"c4\">Rogue</span>-only ring, but it has since been changed and is <b>now available to all classes</b>. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304642.png\" id=\"1304642\"><img height=\"250\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1304642.png?maxHeight=250\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image border\" alt=\"Field Researcher's Loop\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; border-width: 2px;\"></a></div><br><br>Wowhead User Patrickjarvis324 completed this as an Alliance player and detailed the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=277203/scholarly-pendant#comments:id=6436230\" data-contiguous=\"true\">recommended books to acquire 20</a>. Now that players can reach level 30, some of these will likely be much easier to obtain.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Throughout the world in World of Warcraft: Forever, players can collect various books that allow them to unlock new quests. At 20 books, you unlock the quest <a href=\"/forever/quest=79536/greater-friend-of-the-library\">Greater Friend of the Library</a>, which grants the player one of two rings, including <a href=\"/forever/item=281634/field-researchers-loop\">Field Researcher's Loop</a>. This item was previously a Rogue-only ring, but it has since been changed and is <b>now available to all classes</b>. <br /><br />Wowhead User Patrickjarvis324 completed this as an Alliance player and detailed the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=277203/scholarly-pendant#comments:id=6436230\">recommended books to acquire 20</a>. Now that players can reach level 30, some of these will likely be much easier to obtain.</noscript>            \n        ",
